   ("Writing formulae", ["Use the valency of the elements or radicals: sodium (Na, valency 1) and chlorine (Cl, valency 1) → NaCl; calcium (2) and oxygen (2) → CaO; aluminium (3) and oxygen (2) → Al₂O₃. Common radicals: OH⁻, NO₃⁻, SO₄²⁻, CO₃²⁻, NH₄⁺. The valencies (or charges) must balance."]),
